Kerman, Koonin (FKK) theory [Ch93].  Discrete level data from     8237 1451  152
nuclear data sheets were matched to continuum level densities     8237 1451  153
using the formulation of Ignatyuk [Ig75] and pairing and shell    8237 1451  154
parameters from the Cook [Co67] analysis. Neutron and charged-    8237 1451  155
particle transmission coefficients were obtained from the         8237 1451  156
optical potentials, as discussed below.  Gamma-ray transmission   8237 1451  157
coefficients were calculated using the Kopecky-Uhl model [Ko90].  8237 1451  158
